    description: "When auto-sync threshold fires and push fails (e.g., remote outage), the sync appears to roll back locally committed ops files, causing data loss. Observed: 15 of 16 tracker items lost after auto-sync push failed 3 times during Codeberg outage. Expected: failed push should preserve local commits and retry on next mutation. Root cause needs investigation — may be a git reset during error recovery."  # e6ab
